[I] Advanced IRC bouncer

[T] ZNC is an advanced IRC bouncer that stays connected to IRC networks so
[T] that clients can detach and reattach without losing their session, with
[T] playback of missed messages. It supports multiple users and networks,
[T] SSL and IPv6, and can be extended with C++, Python and Perl modules.

[U] https://wiki.znc.in/ZNC

[A] Znc Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

